---
description: Inspect Tamil scalars and normalization, not rendered glyphs.
alwaysApply: true
---

Never trust visual Tamil glyph inspection. Use mcp-tamil-oracle tools or explicit
hex escapes. NFC is required unless a golden value has an exact, reasoned Unicode
exception. Inspect decoded JSON escapes too. Never silently delete ZWJ/ZWNJ or
change intentionally decomposed tests. Run just check-unicode after edits.
